function matchesEventTableFilters(event,filters,labels={}){const normalize=value=>String(value||'').normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'').toLocaleLowerCase('es-AR').trim(),values={date:labels.date??event.date,time:labels.time??event.time,title:event.title,group:labels.group??event.group,location:event.location};return Object.entries(filters).every(([key,value])=>!String(value||'').trim()||normalize(values[key]).includes(normalize(value)));}
function applyEventTableFilters(){const month=`${state.date.getFullYear()}-${String(state.date.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')}`,events=state.events.filter(e=>e.status!=='DELETED'&&e.startAt?.slice(0,7)===month);const filtered=events.filter(event=>{const start=new Date(event.startAt),date=[new Intl.DateTimeFormat('es-AR',{day:'2-digit',month:'short',year:'numeric'}).format(start),event.startAt.slice(0,10),new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-GB',{day:'2-digit',month:'2-digit',year:'numeric',timeZone:'America/Argentina/Buenos_Aires'}).format(start)].join(' '),time=[start.toLocaleTimeString('es-AR',{hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'}),event.startAt.slice(11,16)].join(' '),group=groupById(event.groupId)?.name||'';return matchesEventTableFilters(event,eventTableFilters,{date,time,group});});renderEventsTable(filtered);if(currentEventTableSort)sortTableRows($('#events-table'),currentEventTableSort.key,currentEventTableSort.direction);const empty=$('#events-table tbody tr.table-empty-row');if(empty)$('#events-table tbody').append(empty);const count=$('#table-filter-count');if(count)count.textContent=`${filtered.length} de ${events.length} eventos`;}
