function importExcelAllDay(value){const s=String(value??'').trim().toLowerCase();if(value===true||['si','sí','yes','true','1'].includes(s))return true;if(value===false||['no','false','0'].includes(s)||!s)return false;throw new Error('INVALID_IMPORT_ALL_DAY');}
function correctionChoices(context){if(context.includes('Recordatorio'))return ['Predeterminado','5 minutos antes','10 minutos antes','15 minutos antes','30 minutos antes','1 hora antes','1 día antes'];if(context.includes('Hora'))return ['08:00','09:00','09:30','10:00','12:00','13:00','14:00','15:00','16:00','17:00','18:00'];if(context.includes('Recurrencia'))return ['No se repite','Diaria','Semanal','Mensual','Anual'];if(context.includes('Todo el día'))return ['No'];return [];}
